 Resultat übertreffe all seine Erwartungen. Er sagte, er werde in Zukunft noch härter trainieren. Sein Rivale antwortete, das Resultat sei zwar knapp gewesen, aber fair. Der Trainer fügte hinzu, man müsse nun nach vorne schauen. Ein Sportjournalist fügte hinzu, dieser Wettkampf werde wohl als einer der besten Saisons in die Geschichte eingehen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Sportnachricht: Der Tennisprofi über sein bestes Rennen","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, mein Bruder hat erzählt, der Tennisprofi habe gestern das Finale gewonnen.","speaker":"Petra","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Wirklich?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Hast du das selbst gesehen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Nein, ich gebe nur weiter, was er gesagt hat — er sei völlig überraschend gewonnen.","speaker":"Petra","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Interessant, dann schauen wir uns die Highlights später zusammen an.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, mein Bruder hat erzählt, der Tennisprofi habe gestern das Finale gewonnen.","speaker":"Petra","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wirklich? Hast du das selbst gesehen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Nein, ich gebe nur weiter, was er gesagt hat — er sei völlig überraschend gewonnen.","speaker":"Petra","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Interessant, dann schauen wir uns die Highlights später zusammen an.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_060_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Er hat erzählt, der Tennisprofi habe gestern das Finale gewonnen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Gib weiter, was dein Bruder über das Finale erzählt hat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Nein, ich gebe nur weiter, was er gesagt hat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund fragt, ob du es selbst gesehen hast.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Der Kunde sagte, er sei mit dem Resultat nicht zufrieden.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Berichte deiner Chefin, was der Kunde am Telefon sagte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Sie erklärte, sie habe Prüfungsangst gehabt und sei jetzt ruhiger.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Fass ein Interview für die Lerngruppe zusammen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Er sagte, er komme morgen und bringe die Unterlagen mit.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-60-indirekte-rede-grundlagen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Deine Kollegin hat den Kunden nicht gehört. Gib seine Zusage weiter.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":22,"vword-voice-M":22,"vword-listen":22,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Onlineeinkäufe","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":6,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":4,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":6,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Passwörter","from":"vocab-pl